\alttext(All 1,472 channels per genuine observation contribute their positive-spatial fraction, with layer order/means reported explicitly. Layer boundaries retain distinct feature units; the curves are descriptive responses, not class attribution or benchmark predictions.)


> Conclusion

Every learned first filter and all five full-width activation levels remain inspectable on genuine observations. Raw response statistics and explicit normalization prevent weak locally rescaled maps from being treated as strong evidence. These are feature and weight inspections, not classifier-head predictions or causal explanations.

